# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TEMPORARY — diagnostic for phpwebhosting support (created 2026-08-26)
#
# This directory deliberately reproduces a bug that is worked around
# everywhere else on the site, so that support has a live URL to observe.
#
# Declaring RewriteEngine On here means this directory does NOT inherit the
# document root's rewrite rules — including the rule that works around the
# missing protocol header by writing "https://" into redirects by hand. So
# within /temp, Apache behaves as it did before that workaround existed.
#
# Nothing else on the site depends on this directory. Delete it once the
# support ticket is closed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# htaccess-check: exempt - reproduces the bug on purpose for the host's support ticket
RewriteEngine On

# no rules — the point is the absence of the workaround
